  "description": "Command line tool for building and inspecting animated PNGs. Creates an APNG from a sequence of PNG, JPEG, GIF or BMP images, converts GIF to APNG and JPEG or BMP to PNG, makes thumbnails, lists a file's frames and delays, and splits an animation back into composited still frames.",
