  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds --zopfli and --zopfli-iterations to create, convert, resize and extract: files typically 6-9 % smaller than with --smallest, at a steep cost in time. Includes ZopfliSharp (Apache-2.0); see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. extract now rejects unexpected arguments. The standalone binaries add Windows x86 and ARM64, and build 32-bit ARM Linux with NativeAOT.",
